{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Stone of Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 3442270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>We take a classic roguelike deckbuilder (like Slay the Spire), with stand-up pictures hitting each other, and mix in a tactical, procedurally generated map, and you can also use obstacles!<br>We get a stormy mix that creates tens of thousands of combat variations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Usable obstacles!</strong> - Break bridges, throw stones, snack on berries right during the battle - this list can go on for a very long time!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.mp4?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> It is generated with a height difference, obstacles in different places, enemies too, many variations of battles, ambushes, escorts, escape, all this generates such an unusual experience that you can play ENDLESSLY!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.mp4?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Amazing Worlds:</strong> Embark on an exciting adventure across four unique worlds! Discover rare cards, valuable artifacts, unexpected allies, and take on quests ranging from simple tasks to challenging trials. Each journey offers new discoveries and unforgettable experiences!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>We take a classic roguelike deckbuilder (like Slay the Spire), with stand-up pictures hitting each other, and mix in a tactical, procedurally generated map, and you can also use obstacles!<br>We get a stormy mix that creates tens of thousands of combat variations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Usable obstacles!</strong> - Break bridges, throw stones, snack on berries right during the battle - this list can go on for a very long time!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.mp4?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> It is generated with a height difference, obstacles in different places, enemies too, many variations of battles, ambushes, escorts, escape, all this generates such an unusual experience that you can play ENDLESSLY!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.poster.avif?t=1755432820\" width=628 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.webm?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.mp4?t=1755432820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Amazing Worlds:</strong> Embark on an exciting adventure across four unique worlds! Discover rare cards, valuable artifacts, unexpected allies, and take on quests ranging from simple tasks to challenging trials. Each journey offers new discoveries and unforgettable experiences!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The combination of CCG, roguelike, and tactical gameplay with an interactive environment offers a unique experience! Build your own deck, join battles and quests, obtain powerful artifacts by cunning or force, and uncover the mystery of the Stone of Adventure!",
